lilygo-t-display-s3-amoled-pinout.jpg is LilyGO's pinout picture of the T-Display-S3 AMOLED,
image/T-Display-S3-AMOLED.jpg in https://github.com/Xinyuan-LilyGO/T-Display-S3-AMOLED,
recompressed (JPEG quality 85, metadata removed). It is used under that repository's
MIT License, reproduced below.

